#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_multisafepay.field_payment_provider__multisafepay_validate_shopping_cart
msgid "Validate Shopping Cart"
msgstr "Valider le panier"

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_multisafepay.field_payment_provider__multisafepay_validate_shopping_cart
msgid ""
"Ensures the shopping cart items and taxes match the total order amount according to MultiSafepay's rounding rules."
msgstr "Assure que les articles du panier et les taxes correspondent au montant total de la commande selon les règles d'arrondi de MultiSafepay."

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_multisafepay.payment_provider_form_multisafepay
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avancé"

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_multisafepay.field_payment_provider__multisafepay_active_shopping_cart
msgid "BNPL Support"
msgstr "Support BNPL"

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_multisafepay.field_payment_provider__multisafepay_active_shopping_cart
msgid ""
"Activate this option to show the cart items on the MultiSafepay payment page, which is required to support BNPL. Note: If disabled, the payment methods that require a shopping cart and are commonly known as BNPL won't work: Riverty - Afterpay, in3, Klarna and Billink."
msgstr "Activez cette option pour afficher les articles du panier sur la page de paiement MultiSafepay, ce qui est nécessaire pour le support BNPL. Remarque : Si désactivé, les méthodes de paiement qui nécessitent un panier et généralement appelées BNPL ne fonctionneront pas : Riverty - Afterpay, in3, Klarna et Billink."

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_multisafepay/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "There was a problem processing your payment."
msgstr "Un problème est survenu lors du traitement de votre paiement."

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_multisafepay.payment_provider_form_multisafepay
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Attention :"

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_multisafepay.payment_provider_form_multisafepay
msgid "If disabled, the payment methods that require a shopping cart and are known as BNPL won't work: Riverty - Afterpay, in3, Klarna and Billink."
msgstr "Si désactivé, les méthodes de paiement qui nécessitent un panier et appelées BNPL ne fonctionneront pas : Riverty - Afterpay, in3, Klarna et Billink."
